@startuml Terraform CI/CD Architecture

title Архитектура Terraform CI/CD с удалённым состоянием

package "GitHub Repository" as GitHub {
  folder "Task2Advanced/" as Task2 {
    folder ".github/workflows/" as Workflows {
      component "terraform-plan.yml" as PlanWorkflow
      component "terraform-apply.yml" as ApplyWorkflow
    }
    folder "envs/dev/" as DevEnv {
      component "main.tf" as DevMain
      component "backend.tf" as DevBackend
      component "dev.tfvars" as DevVars
    }
    folder "envs/stage/" as StageEnv {
      component "main.tf" as StageMain
      component "backend.tf" as StageBackend
      component "stage.tfvars" as StageVars
    }
    folder "envs/prod/" as ProdEnv {
      component "main.tf" as ProdMain
      component "backend.tf" as ProdBackend
      component "prod.tfvars" as ProdVars
    }
    folder "modules/vm/" as VmModule {
      component "main.tf" as VmMain
      component "variables.tf" as VmVars
      component "outputs.tf" as VmOut
    }
  }
}

package "GitHub Actions" as Actions {
  component "CI/CD Runner\n(ubuntu-latest)" as Runner
  database "GitHub Secrets" as Secrets
  component "Environment\nProtection" as EnvProtection
}

package "Yandex Cloud" as YC {
  component "Object Storage\n(S3 Backend)" as S3 {
    folder "yc-bucket-terraform-state/" as Bucket {
      folder "dev/" as DevState
      folder "stage/" as StageState
      folder "prod/" as ProdState
    }
  }

  component "IAM Service" as IAM
  component "Compute Cloud" as Compute
  component "VPC Network" as VPC
}

' Developer interactions
actor "Developer" as Dev

' Plan workflow
Dev --> PlanWorkflow : Push PR
PlanWorkflow --> Runner : Trigger workflow
Runner --> DevMain : Checkout code
Runner --> DevBackend : Read backend config
Runner --> S3 : terraform init\n(read state)
S3 --> Runner : Return state

' Updated authentication flow
Runner --> Secrets : Get SA credentials
Secrets --> Runner : YC_SA_KEY_ID, YC_SA_PRIVATE_KEY
Runner --> IAM : yc iam create-token\n--service-account-key-file
IAM --> Runner : IAM token (1 hour)
Runner --> Compute : terraform plan
Compute --> Runner : Plan output
Runner --> Dev : Comment in PR

' Apply workflow
Dev --> ApplyWorkflow : Manual trigger
ApplyWorkflow --> EnvProtection : Check approval
EnvProtection --> Runner : Approved
Runner --> StageBackend : Read backend config
Runner --> S3 : terraform init\n(lock state)
S3 --> Runner : State locked

' Updated authentication flow for apply
Runner --> Secrets : Get SA credentials
Secrets --> Runner : YC_SA_KEY_ID, YC_SA_PRIVATE_KEY
Runner --> IAM : yc iam create-token\n--service-account-key-file
IAM --> Runner : IAM token (1 hour)

Runner --> Compute : terraform apply
Compute --> Runner : Resources created
Runner --> S3 : terraform state push\n(update state)
S3 --> Runner : State updated
Runner --> Dev : Deployment summary

' State management notes
note right of S3
  **State Management:**
  - State file хранится в S3
  - State locking НЕ доступен
  - Защита через GitHub Concurrency
  - Шифрование на rest
end note

note left of Secrets
  **GitHub Secrets:**
  - YC_SA_KEY_ID (не истекает)
  - YC_SA_PRIVATE_KEY (не истекает)
  - YC_FOLDER_ID
  - YC_CLOUD_ID

  **IAM Token:**
  - Получается автоматически
  - Срок действия: 1 час
  - Обновляется при запуске
end note

@enduml
